-- LocalScript: StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts
-- Client-only. No server scripts, remotes, or server permissions.
--
-- Features:
--   Team / All / Specific highlighting
--   Automatically repaired username labels
--   Bright-yellow outlines on specific targets and their usernames
--   Camera-relative waypoints for specific targets
--   Clearly labeled last-known positions when targets stream out
--
-- Streaming limitation:
-- This script cannot discover coordinates the server has never replicated.

